---
import "../../styles/global.css";
const games=[{slug:"lan-house-simulator",name:"Lan House Simulator",genre:"Tycoon · Simulação",desc:"Abra sua lan house, atenda clientes, defina preços e faça o negócio crescer em um cenário isométrico.",status:"Protótipo jogável",href:"/games/lan-house-simulator/"}];
---
<!doctype html><html lang="pt-BR"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="description" content="Jogue projetos HTML5 da Softdown diretamente no navegador."/><title>Games — Softdown</title></head>
<body><header class="site-header"><div class="header-inner"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark">S</span><span class="brand-text">Softdown <strong>Games</strong></span></a><nav class="nav" aria-label="Navegação"><a href="/">Início</a><a href="/#assets">Assets</a><a href="/games/" aria-current="page">Games</a><a href="/sobre-nos/">Sobre nós</a></nav><a class="header-cta" href="/">Voltar ao site</a></div></header>
<main id="main-content"><section class="games-hero"><span class="section-kicker">Softdown Interactive</span><h1>Games</h1><p>Projetos feitos com nossas ferramentas, disponíveis para experimentar no navegador. Cada jogo tem seu espaço próprio.</p></section><section class="games-grid" aria-label="Jogos disponíveis">{games.map(game=><a class="game-card" href={game.href}><div class="game-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="game-art-grid"></div><span class="game-art-icon">LH</span><span class="game-art-tag">HTML5</span></div><div class="game-card-content"><small>{game.genre}</small><h2>{game.name}</h2><p>{game.desc}</p><span class="game-card-bottom"><span>{game.status}</span><strong>Jogar agora →</strong></span></div></a>)}</section><p class="games-footnote">Novos projetos aparecerão aqui como outros cards, sem alterar os jogos existentes.</p></main>
<style>
.games-hero{padding:75px 0 35px}.games-hero h1{font-size:clamp(44px,7vw,78px);margin:10px 0;letter-spacing:-.055em}.games-hero p{max-width:700px;color:var(--muted);font-size:18px;line-height:1.7}.games-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(min(100%,330px),1fr));gap:24px;margin:20px 0}.game-card{display:block;overflow:hidden;background:#121e28;border:1px solid #344653;border-radius:19px;transition:transform .2s,border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}.game-card:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);border-color:#67e39a;box-shadow:0 15px 40px #0005}.game-card:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #67e39a;outline-offset:4px}.game-art{height:215px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#284b50,#152b40 55%,#20283b)}.game-art-grid{position:absolute;inset:-30%;background-image:linear-gradient(#90b9a21c 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,#90b9a21c 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:36px 36px;transform:rotateX(52deg) rotateZ(-30deg)}.game-art-icon{position:relative;border:5px solid #d3a873;box-shadow:12px 12px 0 #0b1725;background:#47685b;color:#ffebc8;padding:22px 30px;font-size:64px;font-weight:900}.game-art-tag{position:absolute;top:15px;right:15px;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#0a1828;color:#93eeb0;font-weight:800;font-size:11px}.game-card-content{padding:25px}.game-card-content small{color:#91e2b5;font-weight:700}.game-card-content h2{font-size:27px;margin:8px 0}.game-card-content p{min-height:70px;color:#bac7d0;line-height:1.6}.game-card-bottom{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding-top:15px;border-top:1px solid #344653;font-size:13px;color:#abb9c7}.game-card-bottom strong{color:#84e8ae}.games-footnote{color:var(--muted);padding:10px 0 65px}
</style></body></html>